| Check | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| first | Runtime MUST retain the first result. |
| second | Runtime MUST retain the second result. |
`;

    expect(deriveSpecMandatoryAcceptanceCriteria(spec).map((entry) => entry.text)).toEqual([
